          ],
          "content": "| (p - 1)(q - 1) | (p - 1)q | (p - 1)(q + 1) |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| p(q - 1) | pq | p(q + 1) |\n| (p + 1)(q - 1) | (p + 1)q | (p + 1)(q + 1) |",
          "captions": [],
