        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.492,
            0.501,
            0.512
          ],
          "content": "2. Expand the following products."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.217,
            0.525,
            0.377,
            0.544
          ],
          "content": "(i) $( 3 + u ) \\; ( \\nu - 3 )$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.525,
            0.52,
            0.67,
            0.547
          ],
          "content": "(ii) $\\frac{2}{3} \\left( 15 \\div 6a \\right)$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.204,
            0.549,
            0.424,
            0.569
          ],
          "content": "(iii) $( 1 0 a + b ) \\; ( 1 0 c + d )$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.522,
            0.55,
            0.689,
            0.569
          ],
          "content": "(iv) $(3  二  x)(x - 6)$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.211,
            0.573,
            0.403,
            0.593
          ],
          "content": "(v) $(-5a+b)(c+d)$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.52,
            0.573,
            0.688,
            0.593
          ],
          "content": "(vi) $\\left( 5 + z \\right) \\left( y + 9 \\right)$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.602,
            0.204,
            0.618
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.624,
            0.398,
            0.643
          ],
          "content": "(i) $3 v - 3 u + u v - 9$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.648,
            0.323,
            0.667
          ],
          "content": "(ii) $1 0 \\pm 4 a$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.672,
            0.488,
            0.691
          ],
          "content": "(iii) $100ac+10\\bar{a}d+10bc+bd$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.696,
            0.376,
            0.716
          ],
          "content": "(iv) $-x^{2}+9x-18$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.72,
            0.442,
            0.739
          ],
          "content": "(v) $-5ac-5ad+bc+bd$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.744,
            0.407,
            0.765
          ],
          "content": "(vi) $5y + yz + 9z + 45$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.774,
            0.847,
            0.83
          ],
          "content": "3. Find 3 examples where the product of two numbers remains unchanged when one of them is increased by 2 and the other is decreased by 4."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.838,
            0.444,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Let numbers be a and b."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.858,
            0.43,
            0.876
          ],
          "content": "Then $(a + 2)   (b - 4) = ab$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.203,
            0.878,
            0.333,
            0.895
          ],
          "content": "So, b = 2a + 4"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.897,
            0.793,
            0.917
          ],
          "content": "Hence 3 examples are $( a = 1 , b = 6 ) , ( a = 2 , b = 8 ) , ( a = 3 , b = 1 0 )$"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.1,
            0.924,
            0.12,
            0.945
          ],
          "content": "2"
        }
      ]
    }
